      <title>Stablecoin Market Shrinks Most Since Terra-Luna’s 2022 Crash</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-16/stablecoin-market-shrinks-most-since-terra-luna-s-2022-crash</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">05c75998686c3ec38656527c</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 17:18:18 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Stablecoins once gave traders a way to ride out crypto selloffs without taking their money out of the industry. Now the market for those dollar-pegged tokens is shrinking at its fastest pace since Terra-Luna collapsed in 2022.</description>
